cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fpinn-delta: fractional physics-informed neural networks for the inverse dynamics of a delta parallel robot"
abstract: "Jupyter notebooks that simulate a delta parallel robot with memory-dependent (Caputo) joint damping, train integer and fractional physics-informed neural networks for its inverse dynamics, and evaluate them open loop and with computed-torque control, including fixed-cost (finite-memory) realizations of the fractional memory term with C kernels."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Angel"
    given-names: "Luis"
    affiliation: "Universidad Pontificia Bolivariana, Bucaramanga, Colombia"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9156-9547"
license: MIT
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-08"
repository-code: "https://github.com/LuisAngel-UPB/fPINN-Delta"
keywords:
  - fractional calculus
  - Caputo derivative
  - physics-informed neural networks
  - delta parallel robot
  - inverse dynamics identification
  - Oustaloup approximation
  - sum of exponentials
  - computed-torque control
